{
  "schema": 1,
  "id": "cyberspec",
  "name": "Cyberspec",
  "description": "Near-black panels cut at two corners with a hatched band, a dot grid and a caption above, in a framed screen; solid tone slabs with dark ink for warnings, current rows, tabs and chips; big cyan readouts with small decimals over a rule; 20-cell meters, hexagon gauges, signal graphs and departure-board rows; Kode Mono titles, values that roll and glitch, rows that slide in and a page that boots card by card. After Cyberspec by Agnel Nieves (MIT), github.com/agnelnieves/cyberspec.",
